# Incubate's Incubator and the Phyrexian Token it transforms into are the rules' (CR 701.53a, 111.10i), not words of
# Sunfall's text: its reminder text is no rules text (CR 207.2a), so a text change reaches no word of it (CR 612.2).
# Artificial Evolution replaces Phyrexian with Elf in Sunfall's text as it waits on the stack; Sunfall exiles the
# Ornithopter and makes an Incubator Token with a +1/+1 counter, which paying {2} turns into a 1/1 Phyrexian artifact
# creature named Phyrexian Token, no Elf.

